<</if>>

:: Forest Mansion Master Suite
<<set $outside to 0>><<location "abandoned_mansion">><<set $forestmansionstage to 11>><<effects>>
<<if $rng lte 50 and $eventskip is 0>>
	<<forestmansionrandomevents>>
<<else>>
