<</if>>

:: Forest Mansion Sleep
<<set _autosavehere to true>>
<<sleepeffects>><<sleep>><<effects>>

<<if $TaylorWith is 1>>
	"Wait, you want to sleep here? Well it is past dark and we're in the middle of the woods." <<He>> sighs "How will I explain this to my mother, especially after the last incident." The two of you lie in bed and try to sleep. Most of the night you're plagued with chills before the sun comes back up. 
	<br><br>
	<<clifficon>><<link [[Agree|Forest Mansion Coffee Ending]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<danubeicon>><<link [[Disagree|Forest Mansion Goodbye]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $rng gte 80>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>><<person2>>You awaken to a few shapes looming over you and hands pulling off your covers. It's a <<person>> and <<his>> friend. "Don't struggle," <<he>> says.
	"We didn't expect to find such a nice treat during our visit, let us have some fun."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Sleep Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif ($ghost is 0 and $slime is 0 and $mushroom is 0 and $exorcised is 0 and $rng lte 10 and $settings.transformAnimalEnabled and $settings.transformDivineEnabled) or ($ghost is 0 and $slime is 0 and $mushroom is 0 and $exorcised is 1 and $rng lte 15 and $settings.transformAnimalEnabled and $settings.transformDivineEnabled)>>
	You rest your head on the pillow and drift off to sleep. You don't get a very good rest, constantly interrupted by chills in the night. When you finally wake up proper, you sit up and stretch before getting out of bed.
	<br><br>
	…Though, as you get ready for the day, something feels… off. You place a hand on your temple, wondering if it's sickness, but feel nothing at all. You panic, rushing to the mirror to find yourself completely changed.
	<br><br>
	Your skin is ghostly pale, and strange blue flaming orbs loom around you. Your breathing gets heavier. You go to touch your face, hoping the earlier attempt was all in your head. In your panic, you put a bit more force into it than you had before, and your hand phases right through, getting stuck inside. 
	<br><br>
	You pull and pull and finally manage to rip it loose. Semi-solid chunks and blue fluid leak and dribble from where it once was. 
	<br><br>
	It's finally settling in. Your body is gone. You attempt to calm yourself before considering what to do next.
	<br><br>
	<<set Skin.color.natural to "ghost">>
	<<set V.transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "default">>
	<<set V.transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "default">>
	<<set $haircolour to "ghost">>
	<<set $hairfringecolour to "ghost">>
	<<set $makeup.browscolour to "ghost">>
	<<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
	<<set $ghost to 1>>
	<<earnFeat "Ghost">>
	<<if $forestmansionstage is 11>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Master Suite]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Guest Suite]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You rest your head on the old mansion's pillow and drift off to sleep. You don't get a very good rest, constantly interrupted by chills before waking up. You sit up and stretch before getting out of the bed.
	<br><br>
	<<if $forestmansionstage is 11>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Master Suite]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Forest Mansion Guest Suite]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Forest Mansion Coffee Ending
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
"Great! Let's go to the Ocean Breeze Cafe then." You two make your way to the cafe and take a seat. Taylor sighs "That expedition was less exciting than I thought. So much for being haunted that place barely had anything worthwhile. Oh two coffees please." <<He>> says to the barista. "The only part that made that trip fun was you, so thanks for coming with." <<He>> smiles. "Anyway I better get home before my mom kills me. See you soon."
<br><br>

<<clifficon>><<link [[Next|Cliff Street]]>><<endevent>><<pass 90>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Goodbye
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
"Okay I understand. Have a great day then I better get home." <<He>> says waving as he heads inside.
<br><br>

<<danubeicon>><<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><<pass 90>><</link>>

:: Forest Mansion Taylor Leave
<<set $TaylorWith to 0>>
"You want to leave already?" Taylor asks sadly, "Okay I guess if you're not having a good time we can." You walk together back to the town. "If you ever want to go to another location you know where to find me." <<He>> says as <<he>> gives you a hug and heads home.
<br><br>

<<danubeicon>><<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><<pass 90>><</link>>

